            "title": "幣安Binance遭駭損失63億美元　成史上最大盜竊案？",
            "description": "<div class=\"post-body\" id=\"gallery-lightbox\">\n\n<div class=\"videoStoryPlayer\">\n\n\n\n\n<iframe allow=\"autoplay\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" data-src=\"https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/video/202610/30/6ae42554e4b036a1b38df4be/63daa8a895554ba1a5c587acf8e1c14d.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202610/30/6ae42602e4b036a1b38df5021.jpg\" data-videoid=\"AP6ae42bafe4b02fd1c5f5fe80\" height=\"100%\" id=\"playVideoAP6ae42bafe4b02fd1c5f5fe80\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/video/202610/30/6ae42554e4b036a1b38df4be/63daa8a895554ba1a5c587acf8e1c14d.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202610/30/6ae42602e4b036a1b38df5021.jpg&amp;playerId=AP6ae42bafe4b02fd1c5f5fe80\" width=\"100%\"></iframe>\n<script>\n          /*<![CDATA[*/\n          var contentType = $(\"#storyContentType\").val();\n          var liveStatus = $(\"#liveStatus\").val();\n          var bHeight = $(\"iframe\").width();\n          var liveUrl = $(\"#liveUrl\").val();\n          var livePlayUrl = 'https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=';\n          console.log(contentType, liveStatus);\n          var tubUrl = 'https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202610/30/6ae42602e4b036a1b38df5021.jpg';\n                        \n                         if (contentType == 3) {\n                         if (liveStatus == 1) {\n                         var iframeUrl = livePlayUrl + liveUrl + '&p=' + tubUrl + '&isLive=true' + '&playerId=' + $(\"#storyID\").val();\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer iframe,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer iframe\").attr(\"src\", iframeUrl);\n                         } else if ((liveStatus == 2 && liveUrl == \"\") || liveStatus==0) {\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer\").css(\"display\", \"none\");\n                         }\n                         }\n                         /*]]>*/\n        </script>\n</div>\n<div class=\"storyContent\"><p>【點新聞報道】幣安（Binance）<strong>官方確認發生安全漏洞事件，造成約63億美元資產損失</strong>。根據初步調查，黑客通過入侵交易所一名工程師的筆記本電腦，進而訪問幣安系統並進行未經授權提款。</p>\n<p>幣安已與行業合作夥伴協作凍結受影響資產。截至目前，<strong>交易所已成功追回約30億美元，對於其餘約33億美元的資產去向</strong>，幣安尚未公布進一步詳情。幣安聯合創始人何一表示，<strong>公司將承擔此次黑客攻擊造成的全部損失</strong>，充分體現了交易所對用戶保護的承諾。</p>\n<p>為應對危機，<strong>幣安已暫時關閉所有充值和提現功能</strong>，安全團隊正與執法部門和行業夥伴展開緊密協作，追查受影響資產並防止進一步損失。幣安強調，用戶資金安全得到妥善保障。</p>\n\n<p>此消息公布後，<strong>全球加密貨幣市場應聲下行</strong>。比特幣跌幅超過3%，報價至76,368美元，創六周以來新低；以太坊跌幅超過3%，報價至2,178美元，創近兩個月新低；幣安幣在24小時內下跌5%。</p>\n<p>業內分析人士指出，<strong>2026年加密貨幣行業盜竊事件頻發</strong>，9月交易所Bitget才遭遇約3.5億美元被盜事件。隨着人工智能技術的應用，黑客發現系統漏洞的速度已超過企業修復漏洞的效率，這種態勢令投資者對中小型交易所的信心進一步削弱。業內人士警告，此次事件可能促使更多投資者向規模較大、安全防護體系更完善的交易所集中，行業信任危機恐進一步加深。</p>\n<p>（點新聞綜合路透社報道；視頻來源：X）</p></div>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.dotdotnews.com/a/202610/30/AP6ae42bafe4b02fd1c5f5fe80.html",
