            "title": "歐洲央行料維持利率不變　行長拉加德或提前離任",
            "description": "<div class=\"post-body\" id=\"gallery-lightbox\">\n\n<div class=\"videoStoryPlayer\">\n\n\n\n\n<iframe allow=\"autoplay\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" data-src=\"https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/video/202610/30/6ae3f031e4b036a1b38dd85d/4694132bc1a945cea68b335a9e6e98a2.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202610/30/6ae3f073e4b036a1b38dd8661.jpg\" data-videoid=\"AP6ae3f2c9e4b02fd1c5f5f915\" height=\"100%\" id=\"playVideoAP6ae3f2c9e4b02fd1c5f5f915\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/video/202610/30/6ae3f031e4b036a1b38dd85d/4694132bc1a945cea68b335a9e6e98a2.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202610/30/6ae3f073e4b036a1b38dd8661.jpg&amp;playerId=AP6ae3f2c9e4b02fd1c5f5f915\" width=\"100%\"></iframe>\n<script>\n          /*<![CDATA[*/\n          var contentType = $(\"#storyContentType\").val();\n          var liveStatus = $(\"#liveStatus\").val();\n          var bHeight = $(\"iframe\").width();\n          var liveUrl = $(\"#liveUrl\").val();\n          var livePlayUrl = 'https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=';\n          console.log(contentType, liveStatus);\n          var tubUrl = 'https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202610/30/6ae3f073e4b036a1b38dd8661.jpg';\n                        \n                         if (contentType == 3) {\n                         if (liveStatus == 1) {\n                         var iframeUrl = livePlayUrl + liveUrl + '&p=' + tubUrl + '&isLive=true' + '&playerId=' + $(\"#storyID\").val();\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer iframe,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer iframe\").attr(\"src\", iframeUrl);\n                         } else if ((liveStatus == 2 && liveUrl == \"\") || liveStatus==0) {\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer\").css(\"display\", \"none\");\n                         }\n                         }\n                         /*]]>*/\n        </script>\n</div>\n<div class=\"storyContent\"><p>【點新聞報道】歐洲中央銀行30日召開貨幣政策決策會議，<strong>宣布維持存款利率在2.5%不變</strong>。該決定雖在市場預期之內，但其背後的政策信號與機構內部動向引發廣泛關注。</p>\n<p>歐洲央行自6月以來已累計加息兩次，用以應對能源價格上漲帶來的通脹壓力。市場普遍預期，本次按兵不動之際，央行將暗示12月可能進一步加息。貨幣市場目前已定價約三次進一步加息的可能性，這意味着存款利率可能最終推升至3.25%。</p>\n\n<p>更值得關注的是<strong>央行行長拉加德的去留問題</strong>。儘管其任期尚餘一年，但外界盛傳她可能在明年春天法國總統選舉前離任。據報道，世界經濟論壇可能最早於11月任命她為下任主席，這將加速其在央行的離任進程，進而引發高層人事調整。</p>\n<p><strong>法國債券市場的動盪成為更直接的挑戰</strong>。投資者對該國日益沉重的債務負擔及選舉後財政前景日益擔憂。當前法國借貸成本已升至25年以來的最高水平之一，其相對於德國國債的風險溢價更是居高不下，成為整個歐元區最高。</p>\n<p>市場分析普遍認為，<strong>歐洲央行可能被迫採取回應措施以穩定金融市場</strong>。這將考驗央行在維持貨幣政策獨立性與應對特定成員國債務危機之間的平衡。</p>\n<p>（點新聞綜合路透社報道；視頻來源：歐洲央行）</p></div>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.dotdotnews.com/a/202610/30/AP6ae3f2c9e4b02fd1c5f5f915.html",
